Comment:
 vendor/ holds the Rust crates from Cargo.lock, added to the source tarball
 by `meson dist` (build-aux/dist-vendor.sh). Each crate's license is given
 in its Cargo.toml and license files. All are DFSG-free. The licenses used,
 alone, as alternatives or combined, are MIT, Apache-2.0 (with or without
 the LLVM exception), BSD-1-Clause, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, 0BSD, ISC,
 Zlib, BSL-1.0, Unlicense, Unicode-3.0 and LGPL-2.1-or-later. This stanza needs to be expanded to one per crate before
 the package can go into the Debian archive.

